From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:32:07 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] phy: samsung: usbdrd: add Google gs201 USB 3.1 DRD PHY
 compatible

The gs201 USB DRD PHY has the same IP version and power control offsets
as gs101, at a different base. Reuse the gs101 data. Verified with
USB 2.0 gadget mode on a Pixel 7 Pro.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/phy/samsung/phy-exynos5-usbdrd.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/phy/samsung/phy-exynos5-usbdrd.c b/drivers/phy/samsung/phy-exynos5-usbdrd.c
index 8711a3b62..8f9841740 100644
--- a/drivers/phy/samsung/phy-exynos5-usbdrd.c
+++ b/drivers/phy/samsung/phy-exynos5-usbdrd.c
@@ -2879,6 +2879,9 @@ static const struct of_device_id exynos5_usbdrd_phy_of_match[] = {
 	{
 		.compatible = "google,gs101-usb31drd-phy",
 		.data = &gs101_usbd31rd_phy
+	}, {
+		.compatible = "google,gs201-usb31drd-phy",
+		.data = &gs101_usbd31rd_phy
 	}, {
 		.compatible = "samsung,exynos2200-usb32drd-phy",
 		.data = &exynos2200_usb32drd_phy,
